                                "sense_id": "02e01be7-98ec-3b8f-aa40-4c338422f00c",
                                "text": "If in an harmonic range one point halve innerly the tract between two conjugates, the other (its conjugate) must halve the same tract outerly, i.e., must be at ∞."
